    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\underbrace{A B}_{12} \\quad \\underbrace{\\text { MN........Z }}_{13} \\\\\n& =\\underset{\\substack{\\text { Selection of two } \\\\\n\\text { leters before } \\mathrm{M}}}{{ }^{12} \\mathrm{C}_2} \\times \\underset{\\substack{\\text { Selection of two } \\\\\n\\text { leter after } \\mathrm{M}}}{{ }^{13} \\mathrm{C}_2}=5148\n\\end{aligned}$",
